    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "There is a species, in the far corners of the universe, which many are aware of. Small Avian-like creatures, waddling beasts with beaks and flightless wings. They operate as space pirates, rogues and renegades. Legend tells that they are the children of Kluex himself, cast out due to their wicked ways; the first Flightless.",
    "value": "宇宙边陲，存在着一支诸多文明皆有所闻的种族。此乃形似翼族之小型生物，蹒跚而行，生有喙部与无法翱翔之翼。彼等横行星海，为寇为盗，叛离正道。传说揭示，其本为克鲁西斯亲生之子嗣，却因行径邪恶遭致放逐，沦为“最初的失翼者”。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "Kluex laments the loss of his children, and their spiral into darkness. But they will not embrace him, will not return to the fold. And thus, it is any good Avian's duty to report a space pirate penguin sighting to the nearest authorities.",
    "value": "克鲁西斯为其子嗣的沦丧与沉沦黑暗而悲叹。然彼等拒不拥抱父神，亦不愿重归翼下。是故，凡我虔信翼族，皆有义务将太空海盗企鹅之踪迹，禀报于最近之权威。"
